@startuml CU-04
actor "Administrador" as Adm
boundary "«UI» Angular (admin)" as UI
control "«Controller» API /users" as Ctrl
entity "«Model» UserService / user, role, employee" as Model

Adm -> UI : 1: solicitud de administración
UI -> Ctrl : 2: GET /users (listado paginado)
Ctrl -> Model : 3: list_users(db, page, size)
Model --> Ctrl : 4: usuarios + roles
Ctrl --> UI : 5: UserRead[]
UI --> Adm : 6: tabla de usuarios

Adm -> UI : 7: nuevo usuario
UI -> Ctrl : 8: POST /users
Ctrl -> Model : 9: create(db, payload)
Model --> Ctrl : 10: UserRead
Ctrl --> UI : 11: 201
UI --> Adm : 12: cuenta creada con roles

Adm -> UI : 13: editar / habilitar o deshabilitar
UI -> Ctrl : 14: PATCH /users/{id}
Ctrl -> Model : 15: update(db, user_id, payload)
Model --> Ctrl : 16: UserRead actualizado
Ctrl --> UI : 17: 200
UI --> Adm : 18: cambios guardados

Adm -> UI : 19: consultar roles
UI -> Ctrl : 20: GET /users/roles
Ctrl -> Model : 21: list_roles(db)
Model --> Ctrl : 22: RoleRead[]
Ctrl --> UI : 23: roles disponibles

Adm -> UI : 24: vincular empleado
UI -> Ctrl : 25: POST /users/{id}/employee
Ctrl -> Model : 26: link_employee(db, user_id, payload)
Model --> Ctrl : 27: EmployeeRead (branch)
Ctrl --> UI : 28: 201
UI --> Adm : 29: empleado asignado a sucursal

@enduml